cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use spikeforge in your research, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
title: spikeforge
abstract: >-
  A spiking-neural-network (SNN) toolkit built on snnTorch and PyTorch.
  Encodes datasets into rate, latency, delta, and random spikes; trains,
  validates, exports, and deploys LIF networks across a NIR-described
  interpreter spine with cross-framework interoperability (snnTorch,
  Norse, Lava) and a live browser dashboard.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Capsize Games"
    email: contact@capsizegames.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/capsize-games/spikeforge"
url: "https://spikeforge.net"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - spiking neural networks
  - neuromorphic computing
  - snnTorch
  - PyTorch
  - NIR
  - leaky integrate-and-fire
